SUPPLY AGREEMENT v3
Terms and Conditions

This supply agreement contract contains the following terms and conditions:

1. TERM AND TERMINATION
- Initial term: 2 years
- Automatic renewal for 1 year

2. PAYMENT TERMS
Net 30 days from invoice

3. DELIVERY AND PERFORMANCE
- Delivery: Ex-works or FOB as agreed
- On-time performance target: 95%
- Quality AQL: 1.5%

4. LIABILITY AND LIMITATION
- Limitation of liability capped at 12 months supply value
- Excludes consequential damages
- Terms of engagement for dispute resolution

5. FORCE MAJEURE
Standard force majeure clauses with 30-day notice

DEVIATIONS FROM STANDARD TERMS:
These terms and conditions deviate from our standard purchase agreement terms
on several material points requiring careful review.
